 # API

-JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.
+JSON in, JSON out.
+
+## Sites
+
+Set `X-Larder-Site` to a site id such as `main` or `annex`. Requests
+without the header use `main`. An unknown id returns HTTP 400 with code
+`unknown_site`.
+
+Batch lists, details and waste operations, on-hand quantities (including the
+stock CSV), cooking, alerts, nightly checks, stock value and stock-takes use
+the selected site. Receiving an order requires locations at that site.
+Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.

 ## Errors

@@ -15,3 +26,29 @@ language.

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
